=== 9. READ THAT PASS WITH THE AGENT CAVEAT ==================================
The Agent Track is tools/benchmark/driver/manual-driver.ts (ManualAgentDriver, profile A001) — scripted,
no LLM endpoint anywhere in tools/benchmark/driver/*.ts (no fetch, no API key). Every row reports
repairs=0 and denials=[], so agentFinalSuccessRate=1.0 / firstCompileSuccessRate=1.0 measure the test
author's pre-authored patches, not a model. The gate reaches overall PASS while its Agent dimension is a
proxy. This is the strongest claimed-vs-verified instance in the audit:
  "v06-report PASS"  !=  "Agent capability verified".
Also: 1 of 10 trials is dropped from eligibleTrials with the reason only visible as byDomain DEVICE.
